 pull request when it changed.

-|                         |                                                           |
-|-------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
-| `index.html`            | the shell: masthead, and the one `<script type="module">` |
-| `assets/app.js`         | the hash router, and the provenance line in the footer    |
